            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Make the <code>ArcadeRun</code> class inherit from the <code>GameRun</code> class and call <code>start()</code> on an <code>ArcadeRun</code> object.</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"184\" endIndex=\"191\" /><option startIndex=\"192\" endIndex=\"199\" /><option startIndex=\"283\" endIndex=\"287\" /><option startIndex=\"287\" endIndex=\"288\" /><option startIndex=\"288\" endIndex=\"293\" /><option startIndex=\"293\" endIndex=\"294\" /><option startIndex=\"294\" endIndex=\"295\" /></options></interaction></interactions><content><text value=\"class\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"GameRun\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"{\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"constructor\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\"(score) {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"this\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\".score = score;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" }\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" start() {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Run started with score &quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\" + \" /><text value=\"this\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\".score);\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" }\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"class\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"SpeedRun\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"extends\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"GameRun\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"{}\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"class\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"ArcadeRun\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"extends\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"GameRun\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"{}\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" run1 = \" /><text value=\"new\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" SpeedRun(\" /><text value=\"1200\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" run2 = \" /><text value=\"new\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" ArcadeRun(\" /><text value=\"300\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"run1.start();\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"run2.start();\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Make sure to pick <code>extends</code> followed by <code>GameRun</code> and then <code>run2</code>, <code>.</code>, <code>start</code>, <code>(</code>, <code>)</code>.</p></body></html>"
