ctivated!&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" }\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" run1 = \" /><text value=\"new\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" SpeedRun(\" /><text value=\"1200\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"run1.usePowerUp();\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Make sure to pick <code>usePowerUp() {</code> followed by <code>}</code> and then <code>run1</code>, <code>.</code>, <code>usePowerUp</code>, <code>(</code>, <code>)</code>.</p></body></html>"
